1898 - Death of Bismarck 1930 - First ever soccer World Cup Final (Uruguay 4 Argentina 2) 1935 - First Penguin paperback published (Ariel, A Life of Shelley) 1949 - HMS Amethyst reached Hong Kong after running the gauntlet of Chinese communist troops in the Yangtse River 1966 - England beat West Germany 4-2 to win soccer's World Cup
